+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_chromium" translatable="false">Built on Chromium 157.0.8103.78, with the latest security fixes.</string>
+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_player" translatable="false">Bare\'s own video player: swipe down to close, pinch to zoom, and a Quality choice for streaming video.</string>
+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_bgaudio" translatable="false">Video sound keeps playing when you switch apps or turn the screen off.</string>
+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_canvas" translatable="false">Block canvas reading stops sites from fingerprinting you through the canvas. Allow it per site from the menu.</string>
+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_bareguard" translatable="false">Bare Guard puts Bare\'s protections in one place, BareFilter included.</string>
+    <string name="bare_whats_new_205_leakcheck" translatable="false">The leaked-password check, which could contact Google, is now off.</string>
